 "Cells" -> {<|"Data" -> ".md\n# Release notes *2.8.3*\n<Now/>\n\nRate your \
experience with the previous release. Your feedback is important for \
us\n\n<style>\n    .rating { \n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: \
row-reverse;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n    .rating input {\n    \
  display: none;\n    }\n    .rating label {\n      font-size: 2rem;\n      \
color: #ccc;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: color 0.2s;\n    }\n  \
  .rating input:checked ~ label,\n    .rating label:hover,\n    .rating \
label:hover ~ label {\n      color: rgb(248 113 113);\n    }\n    .feedback \
{\n      display: block;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 400px;\n      \
margin: 1rem auto;\n      padding: 0.5rem;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n    }\n   \
 .submit-btn {\n      display: block;\n      margin: 0.5rem auto;\n      \
padding: 0.5rem 1rem;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }  \
\n</style>\n\n<form onsubmit=\"return false\" class=\"flex flex-col\" \
id=\"rating-c\">\n    <fieldset>\n      <div class=\"rating\" \
id=\"rating-form\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" id=\"star5\" \
name=\"rating\" value=\"5\" />\n        <label \
for=\"star5\">\[FivePointedStar]</label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" \
id=\"star4\" name=\"rating\" value=\"4\" />\n        <label \
for=\"star4\">\[FivePointedStar]</label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" \
id=\"star3\" name=\"rating\" value=\"3\" />\n        <label \
for=\"star3\">\[FivePointedStar]</label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" \
id=\"star2\" name=\"rating\" value=\"2\" />\n        <label \
for=\"star2\">\[FivePointedStar]</label>\n        <input type=\"radio\" \
id=\"star1\" name=\"rating\" value=\"1\" />\n        <label \
for=\"star1\">\[FivePointedStar]</label>\n      </div>\n    </fieldset>\n    \
<input type=\"text\" id=\"feedback-form\" name=\"feedback\" \
style=\"width:20rem\" class=\"border-1 ml-auto mr-auto align-center \
rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 ring-0 text-sm py-1\" placeholder=\"one-line \
feedback...\" maxlength=\"100\" />\n</form>\n\nTell your thoughts, what you \
would like to see or anything else. The form will be sent automatically once \
you have finished.", "Display" -> "codemirror", 
    "Hash" -> "657e036f-f582-44e0-b62e-ae9c8873ad9f", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"Hidden" -> True|>, 
