   <|"Data" -> ".md\n## New AsyncFunction Methods\n`TableAsync` and `DoAsync` \
were added to be used within asynchronious functions. They work in the same \
way as corresponding symbols from Wolfram Language, but the inner expression \
can be an implicit `AsyncFunction`. For example:", "Display" -> "codemirror", 
