supporting us: \n\n<br/>\n\n- __write a blog post about WLJS__\n- tell a \
colleague\n\nor\n\n- [Open \
Collective](https://opencollective.com/wljs-notebook)\n- \
[PayPal](https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=BN9LWUUUJGW54)\n- \
[GitHub Sponsors](https://github.com/sponsors/JerryI)\n\nYour contributions \
help keep our project alive and improve the experience for everyone.", 
    "Display" -> "codemirror", "Hash" -> 
     "b6a0ce03-2ec1-4b36-8343-04490cec359e", "Invisible" -> False, 
    "MetaOnly" -> False, "Props" -> <|"Hidden" -> True|>, 
